<resources>
    <!--
    SETUP — Debug build Google Maps API key
    =======================================
    This file is a template. Copy it to:
        app/src/debug/res/values/google_maps_api.xml
    and replace the placeholder with your real key.

    This key is used ONLY for the Android Maps SDK (map tile rendering).
    Directions API requests are now proxied through the FastAPI backend,
    so this key never makes web-service calls and can be safely restricted.

    RECOMMENDED RESTRICTION (Google Cloud Console)
    -----------------------------------------------
    Restrict this key to "Android apps" and add:
      • Package name:  com.shubham.womensafety
      • SHA-1 fingerprint: run  ./gradlew signingReport  and copy the
        SHA-1 for the debug variant

    HOW TO GET A KEY
    ----------------
    1. Go to https://console.cloud.google.com → APIs & Services → Credentials
    2. Create an API key (or reuse an existing one)
    3. Enable "Maps SDK for Android" on your project
    4. Apply the Android-app restriction described above
    5. Replace the placeholder below with your key (it starts with "AIza")
    -->
    <string name="google_maps_key" templateMergeStrategy="preserve" translatable="false">YOUR_DEBUG_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY</string>
</resources>
